Paddle upstream toward Wellesley for near-total quiet, or downstream past Norumbega for the classic postcard view. Lessons and guided sunset paddles run midweek in summer.', 'auburndale', 'fitness', '2401 Commonwealth Avenue, Auburndale, MA 02466', 42.3469, -71.243, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pony_Truss_Trail_and_the_Charles_River%2C_December_2025.jpg/1920px-Pony_Truss_Trail_and_the_Charles_River%2C_December_2025.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 22, 45, false, null, null, 'Daily, April–October', 'https://paddleboston.com', null, ARRAY['kayak', 'paddleboard', 'rental', 'summer']::text[], false, 4.8, 214, 257, 33)
