No registration needed, but the room fills up — arrive five minutes early in winter. Free, like everything at the library.', 'auburndale', 'family-kids', '375 Auburn Street, Auburndale, MA 02466', 42.3449, -71.252, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Auburndale_Library%2C_Auburndale_MA.jpg/1920px-Auburndale_Library%2C_Auburndale_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2026-10-28T14:30:00.000Z', '2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z', 'Every Wednesday, year-round', null, null, ARRAY['toddlers', 'library', 'indoor', 'free']::text[], false, 4.9, 58, 394, 62)
