Bring your own paddle and a ball. Courts are first-come, first-served; weekday mornings are the sweet spot if you want a game without waiting.', 'auburndale', 'fitness', 'Auburn Street at Melrose Avenue, Auburndale, MA 02466', 42.3429, -71.25, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pony_Truss_Trail_and_the_Charles_River%2C_December_2025.jpg/1920px-Pony_Truss_Trail_and_the_Charles_River%2C_December_2025.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, 'Daily, dawn to dusk', null, null, ARRAY['pickleball', 'open play', 'outdoor', 'free']::text[], false, 4.5, 73, 531, 91)
