Free to browse, and most artists sell directly. The buildings themselves — timber beams, huge industrial windows — are half the appeal.', 'newton-upper-falls', 'arts-culture', 'Oak Street mill buildings, Newton Upper Falls, MA 02464', 42.3118, -71.2211, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Prospect_Block%2C_Newton_Upper_Falls_MA.jpg/1920px-Prospect_Block%2C_Newton_Upper_Falls_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-07T22:00:00.000Z', 'First Saturday of May and November', null, null, ARRAY['open studios', 'local art', 'shopping', 'free']::text[], false, 4.7, 71, 1967, 183)
