Reservations strongly advised on weekends. Expect $30–$45 entrées; the bar menus are a good cheaper entry point.', 'newton-upper-falls', 'food-drink', 'Needham Street, Newton Upper Falls, MA 02464', 42.3133, -71.2186, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b0/NewtonMA_NewtonUpperFalls.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 30, 60, false, null, null, 'Tue–Sun dinner, from 5pm', null, null, ARRAY['dinner', 'patio', 'date night', 'reservations']::text[], false, 4.5, 213, 2104, 32)
