Registration is free but capped at twenty kids. Long pants recommended — there is poison ivy off-trail.', 'newton-upper-falls', 'family-kids', 'Hemlock Gorge Reservation, Ellis Street, Newton Upper Falls, MA 02464', 42.3168, -71.2171, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/A_closer_view_of_the_Echo_Bridge%2C_Sudbury_Aqueduct.jpg/1920px-A_closer_view_of_the_Echo_Bridge%2C_Sudbury_Aqueduct.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2027-05-15T14:00:00.000Z', '2027-05-15T15:30:00.000Z', 'Third Saturday of the month, May–October', null, null, ARRAY['nature program', 'ages 5-10', 'guided', 'free']::text[], false, 4.8, 44, 2241, 61)
