Goes on rain or shine. SNAP and HIP are accepted, and the market matches HIP dollars for fruit and vegetables.', 'newtonville', 'food-drink', 'Walnut Street at Austin Street, Newtonville, MA 02460', 42.3517, -71.2068, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Masonic_Building%2C_2022%2C_Newtonville_MA.jpg', 'varies'::price_type, null, null, true, '2026-10-27T17:30:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T22:30:00.000Z', 'Tuesdays, mid-June through October', null, null, ARRAY['farmers market', 'local', 'produce', 'SNAP/HIP']::text[], true, 4.7, 203, 2378, 90)
