Pool passes are per-season or per-visit; residents get priority for swim lessons, which fill in April. The track is open to the public whenever teams are not using it.', 'newtonville', 'fitness', '750 Watertown Street, Newtonville, MA 02460', 42.3532, -71.2048, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Masonic_Building%2C_2022%2C_Newtonville_MA.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 8, 12, false, null, null, 'Pool late June–Labor Day; fields year-round', null, null, ARRAY['swimming', 'pool', 'track', 'tennis', 'family']::text[], false, 4.4, 167, 2515, 119)
