Walkable from the Newtonville station, which makes it the easiest Newton night out without a car. Weekends get busy after eight.', 'newtonville', 'nightlife', 'Washington Street, Newtonville, MA 02460', 42.3502, -71.2098, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Masonic_Building%2C_2022%2C_Newtonville_MA.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 12, 45, false, null, null, 'Nightly, most kitchens until 10pm', null, null, ARRAY['bars', 'cocktails', 'T-accessible', '21+']::text[], false, 4.5, 176, 252, 148)
