The author-event series punches well above the store’s size — nationally touring novelists read here regularly. Events are usually free with a book purchase; check the calendar and RSVP.', 'newtonville', 'shopping', '10 Langley Road, Newtonville, MA 02460', 42.3497, -71.2063, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Masonic_Building%2C_2022%2C_Newtonville_MA.jpg', 'varies'::price_type, null, null, false, null, null, 'Daily, 10am–7pm', null, null, ARRAY['bookstore', 'author events', 'independent', 'rainy day']::text[], true, 4.9, 288, 389, 177)
