Drop in any time during market hours. Free, no registration, aimed at ages 3–9.', 'newtonville', 'family-kids', 'Walnut Street at Austin Street, Newtonville, MA 02460', 42.3522, -71.2063, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Masonic_Building%2C_2022%2C_Newtonville_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T21:00:00.000Z', 'Tuesdays with the market, June–October', null, null, ARRAY['crafts', 'ages 3-9', 'drop-in', 'free']::text[], false, 4.6, 51, 526, 26)
