Go hungry: sausage and peppers, arancini, zeppole, and Italian ice. Free to attend; bring cash for food and rides. Parking is impossible — walk in from Watertown Street.', 'nonantum', 'seasonal-events', 'Adams Street, Nonantum, MA 02458', 42.3608, -71.2003, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg/1920px-Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg', 'varies'::price_type, null, null, true, '2027-07-15T21:00:00.000Z', '2027-07-19T03:00:00.000Z', 'Thursday–Sunday, mid-July', null, null, ARRAY['festival', 'italian', 'food', 'fireworks', 'family']::text[], true, 4.9, 421, 663, 55)
