Go Saturday morning and expect a numbered-ticket line. Cash is still king at a couple of counters. Bread sells out well before noon.', 'nonantum', 'food-drink', 'Watertown Street, Nonantum, MA 02458', 42.3593, -71.2023, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg/1920px-Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 5, 30, false, null, null, 'Tue–Sun mornings', null, null, ARRAY['bakery', 'italian', 'cannoli', 'cash preferred']::text[], true, 4.8, 312, 800, 84)
