Balls are usually on site. Standing at the fence for ten minutes is the accepted way to get asked to play. The park also has a playground and a small lawn.', 'nonantum', 'outdoors-parks', 'Pellegrini Park, Adams Street, Nonantum, MA 02458', 42.3613, -71.2028, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg/1920px-Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, 'Afternoons and evenings, April–October', null, null, ARRAY['bocce', 'local culture', 'social', 'hidden gem', 'free']::text[], false, 4.7, 86, 937, 113)
