Sunday afternoon is the right time to go — multigenerational tables, everyone in a good mood. Most places take walk-ins; a few are cash-friendly and reservation-averse.', 'nonantum', 'food-drink', 'Watertown Street, Nonantum, MA 02458', 42.3588, -71.2008, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg/1920px-Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 18, 34, false, null, null, 'Wed–Sun, dinner from 4pm', null, null, ARRAY['italian', 'family style', 'comfort food', 'groups']::text[], false, 4.6, 244, 1074, 142)
