Free, and about as purely local as Newton gets. Food is by neighborhood organizations, so bring cash and small bills.', 'nonantum', 'seasonal-events', 'Watertown Street at Adams Street, Nonantum, MA 02458', 42.3618, -71.2008, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg/1920px-Coletti-Magni_Park%2C_Nonantum_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2027-09-11T14:00:00.000Z', '2027-09-11T20:00:00.000Z', 'Second Saturday of September', null, null, ARRAY['block party', 'parade', '5K', 'family', 'free']::text[], false, 4.7, 118, 1211, 171)
