Cards accepted. Best selection right at opening; by the last hour the tomatoes are usually gone. CSA shares are available for the season.', 'thompsonville', 'food-drink', '303 Nahanton Street, Thompsonville, MA 02459', 42.3138, -71.1964, '', 'paid'::price_type, 3, 25, true, '2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-27T22:00:00.000Z', 'Tue–Sat afternoons, June–October', null, null, ARRAY['farmstand', 'local produce', 'eggs', 'flowers']::text[], false, 4.8, 96, 2170, 14)
