Registration required and caps at twelve kids; a caregiver stays. Runs most Saturdays in the growing season.', 'thompsonville', 'family-kids', '303 Nahanton Street, Thompsonville, MA 02459', 42.3134, -71.196, '', 'paid'::price_type, 15, 15, true, '2027-05-01T13:30:00.000Z', '2027-05-01T15:00:00.000Z', 'Most Saturdays, May–September', null, null, ARRAY['workshop', 'ages 4-8', 'registration', 'farm']::text[], false, 4.9, 63, 2307, 43)
