Fully paved and mostly shaded, which makes it a reliable stroller or dog walk. Add the Nahanton meadow trails for a third mile.', 'thompsonville', 'fitness', 'Winchester Street at Nahanton Street, Thompsonville, MA 02459', 42.3111, -71.1982, '', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, null, null, null, ARRAY['walking', 'dog-friendly', 'stroller-friendly', 'flat', 'free']::text[], false, 4.3, 37, 181, 101)
