Grab a coffee, sit on the bench, and watch the Green Line come and go. Then walk five minutes to the aqueduct trailhead.', 'waban', 'food-drink', 'Beacon Street at Wyman Street, Waban, MA 02468', 42.3273, -71.2301, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg/1920px-Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 4, 16, false, null, null, 'Mon–Sat 7am–5pm, Sun 8am–3pm', null, null, ARRAY['coffee', 'village square', 'T-accessible', 'quick stop']::text[], false, 4.5, 108, 455, 159)
