Twenty to thirty minutes at a kid pace. Muddy in spring. Bring a bug net in June if your children are the kind who collect things.', 'waban', 'family-kids', 'Beethoven Avenue, Waban, MA 02468', 42.3248, -71.2316, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg/1920px-Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, null, null, null, ARRAY['first hike', 'woods', 'ages 3-8', 'short', 'free']::text[], false, 4.4, 48, 592, 8)
