First-come, first-served with the usual local etiquette of one set when others are waiting. Weekday evenings are quiet; Saturday morning has a line.', 'waban', 'fitness', 'Waban Avenue, Waban, MA 02468', 42.3288, -71.2321, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg/1920px-Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, 'Daily, dawn to dusk', null, null, ARRAY['tennis', 'public courts', 'backboard', 'free']::text[], false, 4.3, 57, 729, 37)
