Starts right after dusk in early December and lasts under an hour. Free, and one of the nicest small-town moments in the city.', 'waban', 'seasonal-events', 'Waban Square, Beacon Street, Waban, MA 02468', 42.3276, -71.2298, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg/1920px-Beacon_St%2C_Waban_MA.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2026-12-05T21:30:00.000Z', '2026-12-05T22:30:00.000Z', 'First Saturday of December', null, null, ARRAY['holiday', 'tree lighting', 'family', 'winter', 'free']::text[], false, 4.8, 87, 866, 66)
