A loop up Highland Street and back down Otis takes about an hour. It is entirely a public-sidewalk activity; please admire from the street. Best in late October.', 'west-newton', 'arts-culture', 'Highland Street, West Newton, MA 02465', 42.3467, -71.2238, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/NewtonMA_WestNewtonHillHD.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, null, null, null, ARRAY['architecture', 'walking', 'self-guided', 'fall foliage', 'free']::text[], false, 4.6, 94, 1140, 124)
