Budget $20–$35 a head for dinner plus $14 for the film. Street parking is metered until 8pm; the lot behind the block is free evenings.', 'west-newton', 'food-drink', 'Washington Street, West Newton, MA 02465', 42.3497, -71.2263, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/NewtonMA_WestNewtonVillageCenter.jpg', 'paid'::price_type, 20, 45, false, null, null, 'Nightly, from 5pm', null, null, ARRAY['dinner', 'walkable', 'date night', 'before the movie']::text[], false, 4.5, 172, 1277, 153)
