A hybrid or gravel bike is ideal; the aqueduct section is grass and dirt. Ends back on Washington Street where the coffee is.', 'west-newton', 'fitness', 'Washington Street at Elm Street, West Newton, MA 02465', 42.3477, -71.2278, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/CochituateAqueduct_WabanAvenueNewton.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, false, null, null, null, null, null, ARRAY['cycling', 'flat', 'gravel', 'loop', 'free']::text[], false, 4.5, 66, 1414, 182)
