Stake out curb space by 9:30. Free. The city usually pairs it with a field day and evening fireworks elsewhere in the city — check the schedule.', 'west-newton', 'seasonal-events', 'Washington Street, West Newton, MA 02465', 42.3502, -71.2253, 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/NewtonMA_WestNewtonVillageCenter.jpg', 'free'::price_type, 0, null, true, '2027-07-04T14:00:00.000Z', '2027-07-04T16:00:00.000Z', 'Every July 4th', null, null, ARRAY['parade', 'fourth of july', 'family', 'free', 'summer']::text[], false, 4.7, 198, 1551, 31)
